<title>UK: SGZ Bank sets 250 mln mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>SGZ Bank sets 250 mln mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTS-ZENTRALBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    03.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/=	ISS PRICE  100.045   FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
